			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				102,
				2
			],
			"Message": "style(Rest): Normalize heading spacing and import formatting\n\nAdd an em-quad space entity (&#x2001;) between the \"Rest\" brand name and the wrench emoji in the README heading, matching the project-wide convention for text-to-emoji spacing.\n\nNormalize whitespace in bin/Rest.js by adding blank lines between import statements, variable declarations, and logical code blocks (guard clause, execution block, error handler). This improves readability and aligns with standard JavaScript style conventions.\n\nNo runtime behavior changes.",
			"SHA": "27206fde7633a43e6175a46b3834b2ffd1d12924"
